// `//` starts a line comment, whatever follows it (owner decision
// 2026-11-16, PROP-024: `//=` is not an operator), so a comment that
// begins `//=` is ignored like any other.
//
// Expected, worked by hand: the comment is ignored, so the program prints
// 7 then 8.
fn main() {
    print(7); //=== heading ===
    print(8);
}
